cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If Open Well Data helped you find or check data, please cite it, and cite the original provider of every dataset you use."
title: "Open Well Data: an index of public subsurface data sources"
type: dataset
license:
  - CC-BY-NC-4.0
  - PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Delgado-Uriarte"
    given-names: "Daniel"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-0536-5158"
    website: "https://danieldelgadouriarte.com"
keywords: [well data, drilling data, seismic, well logs, open data, subsurface, oil and gas, data catalogue]
abstract: "Catalogue of public well, drilling, seismic and production data sources with checked access, quoted licences and a verification status per record, plus a Python package (owd) that loads selected datasets with standard channel names and SI units."
